      "label": "general internet audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with internet humor and meme culture, particularly those who appreciate ironic or absurdist juxtapositions. The target community includes individuals who understand the humor in trivializing a simple meal (potato) as a noteworthy lunch, often used to mock or parody the idea of 'pride in poverty' or 'basic living'. The cheerful expression of the man contrasts with the mundane text, appealing to those who enjoy visual gags and relatable, slightly self-deprecating humor.",
